# HEALTH — is the API up, and which mode is it in?
# All requests here are READ ONLY. See README.md for environments and labels.

### READ ONLY — Health (no secret needed)
# Also reports Demo Mode and whether the restore schedule is valid.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### READ ONLY — OpenAPI document (Development only, 404 elsewhere)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
